{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_00_002_23_5_00_002_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:9f672c417ad012273354ea5bd21b5b9e1a18642da435928eba81b5250d385371",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_00_002_23_5_00_002_23:5_00_002_23:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:103bf5f8f6969fba2c7a49163d4733ff158c225c77e5eed1020f27ebfcdb427e",
      "text": "三人一同新年参拜",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_002_23_5_00_002_23:5_00_002_23:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34e73cd896f66dd802cdba9d0abbc85b94874a2227efaa28d45e9d9882865b4c",
      "text": "迎来了新年的315 Production。\n偶像们换上崭新的心情，\n与制作人互致问候。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_002_23_5_00_002_23:5_00_002_23:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1c72dcaa947f9c476566277bfc72213516ce445d3ced2ef0271904306f797ff",
      "text": "新年快乐，制作人！\n我现在正和翼还有樱庭一起新年参拜呢。喂，你们两个也来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_002_23_5_00_002_23:5_00_002_23:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7116cc266ae57ab70e14479cbd9c9562a24392bbcfac5a1a10a9c4df79bdd13b",
      "text": "喂喂，制作人，新年\n快乐！今年也请多多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_002_23_5_00_002_23:5_00_002_23:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:671cd38a07bfd1e10c629601cebeb19b92cf4d82752d3e49c1a1e5bdb6c681e3",
      "text": "新年快乐，制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_002_23_5_00_002_23:5_00_002_23:cmd-000023:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:612097713ed5d721da787f05db2c986630d07a3db86c54f1300aefc3356ec044",
      "text": "新年快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_002_23_5_00_002_23:5_00_002_23:cmd-000024:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82897636ef848d15633bd37c2dab9561925e995878363cafb84522a1b9c15500",
      "text": "今年也请多多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_002_23_5_00_002_23:5_00_002_23:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a88282ed17c1f1c95b8d26709ace73841c4078b2af87affcd375d24020304d18",
      "text": "刚好我们三个的时间都对得上，\n现在正在排队等着参拜呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_002_23_5_00_002_23:5_00_002_23:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84aae358808a81393627b17659a93d226d5bb281b06a5f32e93a45ba381d396d",
      "text": "没错没错，难得来一次，就说干脆去有演艺之神的地方\n参拜吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_002_23_5_00_002_23:5_00_002_23:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad869ddcb5a0e5b3c38d8557ac4480333beb3c7ad69d405a16217c6980969d3c",
      "text": "幸好你们没提京都神社的名字。\n听说那边也很有名。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_002_23_5_00_002_23:5_00_002_23:cmd-000036:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70660fd3671ff43f0430a6d16b3af94e46a8ffcf4f6a2362c7f3ab07332cfee4",
      "text": "京都也有吗？既然这样，明年\n咱们就去那边的神社看看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_002_23_5_00_002_23:5_00_002_23:cmd-000038:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d19d06b46e5c7f8320f594664a55af533c27c865af934b00601434d65129a12",
      "text": "……哈？\n大过年的特意我们三个人去京都？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_002_23_5_00_002_23:5_00_002_23:cmd-000040:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfbb34965edf71c2fac3c97a24d584e81240ec1ef5b6f00ac15e649cb4de36ff",
      "text": "好主意呢！一起去吧，薰先生。\n一定很有趣的。说不定愿望也会实现呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_002_23_5_00_002_23:5_00_002_23:cmd-000042:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c31f150b7ce7312b7984121114cb056dbc7a83aec9648d7a5bf6b59d842dba26",
      "text": "……你们还真能自顾自地兴奋起来啊。哈啊……\n天道、柏木，差不多轮到我们了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_002_23_5_00_002_23:5_00_002_23:cmd-000044:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:344c00545761c9f364bb38e612d452393a327892ff2d64de8d021da885ca7bce",
      "text": "制作人有空的话也一起去吧！\n今年我们几个也拜托你啦！那就先挂啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
